#-    §5✐ Authors Note ✐
§d****************************§

§8I have been so busy that I've not had much time to write anything. This season is crazy!
Oh, did you think I meant busy irl... nah... 
I mean here in Craftadia. Anyway, thank you for your ongoing support my dear readers ❤ 
§7§sStarSweetpea x
#- §6╔═◦♣◦════════╗
     §5Ghostbusters!
§6╚════════◦♣◦═╝§8
Something strange is happening in this neighborhood. The Deathcap Team are now in full swing. We set up our base of operations fast and the Island is growing into a thriving economy. I almost blinked and missed it.
#- §8Even though this place is like a dream come true, it has also had it's fair share of strange anomalies. Nothing is straight forward, there's always a feeling of something being a little 'off'. Even we, the most professional in the business, are talking behind each others backs in the§r 
#- §8dark halls of the main office building. Conspiracies and gossip are everywhere you turn. Did you know about the ghost ghostbuster Demi? She died in her first investigation! But came back for more! Did we stop to question it... nope. We have been far too busy dealing with mold.§r 
#- §8That sounds like nothing, I mean 'sentient' mold! Named Seth. Rather nice... 
for Stachybotrys Chartarum. They just wander about and do we question it... again nope. As HR, I'm drowning in complaints, paperwork... Lx's apples. So much on my mind I'm going to burst. But my work is§r
#- §8important to me. I value the job I have here and I don't regret taking Miss Portinari's offer. She did put my office on the same floor as that Dr Link. Which I hated at first. But I think we may get along just fine now we both know we are on the same page with... umm, nevermind that.§r...
#- §8My work could change the world I just know it! I'm helping people and helping myself at the same time. A win-win. These people are now my family. My chaotic family...§r
§7-------------------
§8If you need apples
please email me at§::
§7§nwitchmag@apples.com
