 A Saga Of Mysteries
#-  §d╔═--═ஓ๑♣๑ஓ═--═╗§r
 §5Who You Gonna§  Call?§r
 §d╚═--═ஓ๑♣๑ஓ═--═╝§r

§dDear Diary,
Things are getting out of hand, very fast! 

So last time I told you about exploring The Sinkhole and finding Magazines written by me that I don't recall writing. Just the start!
#- §dI feel like I'm going a little bit crazy along with everyone else on Deathcap. I'm not the only one sure, but I still feel like I've been the most... effected. Paranoid, that's the word, I am on edge all the time. The glowing eyes I see inside my visions stay there when I come out of them. For a moment...§r
#- §dTrying to understand why is driving me deeper into this state of floating detachment from reality. Must keep myself grounded. Can't loose myself.

Work is great though. The team are the best of the best at what they do. And that's a little of everything. We are in control here.§r
#- §dParanormal investigation (and more) is what I was made for! It thrills me!

Exploring on this island specifically has been enlightening. I know for sure (even though the others don't believe me) that the majority of the strange occurrences have been caused by§r
#- §done single enitity. I know this because I've studied all 'my' books. Magazine 1 to 13, page for page, word for word. The books I wrote that I also never wrote. An enitity named §5ɨȶ§r. §dThe name is prominent throughtout. The energy is so strong. Magnetic. Hypnotic. But if this§r §5ɨȶ§r §dis real, I'm failing to§r§r 
#- §dmake contact. Who do I ask for help when I am that help? This is my department. 
Who do I call? Like a therapist getting a therapist or a doctor going to see a doctor.
Do I even want the help? This feels wrong. My intuition is conflicted. Yelling at me to stay away from them but also do§r  
#- §deverything in my power to find them. 

Hide and Seek.

Is§r §5ɨȶ§r§r hunting me... §dstalking me? Or is§r §5ɨȶ§r §dtrying to warn me... save me? 

Which doors do 
I want to open? 
And can they 
be closed?§r
#-  §2      §6Sweetpea's§r
