#- §5╔═.✵.════════╗  §2    ʙᴇᴀᴄᴏɴ ᴏꜰ ʜᴏᴘᴇ
§5╚════════.✵.═╝
§2Fern's teenage years were hard. She was unlike any other teenager in the village, for she was made of delicate flowers, her skin petals soft to the touch. A Flower Maiden. And ever 
since she found that§r   
#- §2enchanted sword 'The Soultrap' and set free the ancient entity... gossip, whispers and scorn came from the villagers. Day after day, Fern endured the taunts and jeers of her peers, their cruel words cutting deeper than thorns. They mocked her, whispered tales of her mothers§r
#- §2dark magic. Yet, Fern remained resilient, her spirit unbroken despite the cruelty that surrounded her.

One evening, as the sun dipped below the horizon, she held the sword engraved with intricate runes, it seemed to come to life in her hands. It was a love-hate relationship.§r 
#- §2Fern began to train in secret, honing her skills under the moonlit canopy of the forest. As the seasons changed, so too did Fern. No longer the timid flower girl, she emerged as a fierce warrior, her sword gleaming in the sunlight. With each swing she channeled her anger into§r 
#- §2strength, mastering the art of combat with grace and precision.

When the villagers once again turned their scorn upon her, Fern stood tall, her gaze unwavering. With a flick of her wrist, she unsheathed The Soultrap. The bullies recoiled in fear. But she never harmed§r
#- §2them. "Get behind me, NOW!" she demanded. Fern's true strength lay not in her sword, but in her heart. She showed kindness and compassion towards the people who once mocked her as she effortlessly took down a huge bear that had found its way into the village. The village had been saved.§r
#- §2Fern became a protector. She broke down the barriers that divided her from the villagers, forging bonds of friendship that blossomed like the flowers she was made of. And so, in a village once plagued by prejudice and fear, Fern's courage had become a beacon of hope.§r
#- §2To be continued…
§5✿✿❀❀❀✿✿.✿✿❀❀❀✿✿

§2Tune in next time 
for more of... 
ꜰᴇʀɴ'ꜱ ᴀᴅᴠᴇɴᴛᴜʀᴇꜱ!

Read previous stories in the previous issues!
