§c"Joulee, Joulee, Jouleeee JooOUULLLeeeEEe, 
I'm beggin of ya please don't take my man..." Sorry couldn't resist. Well isn't this place cute! I'm a sucker for detail and this small but great 
#- §cshop has stolen my heart. You are greeted by two villagers behind the till. Merchant Marcela and Merchant Marcelo, ready to assist.
Much like The Emotional Support Potato (ESP) has made a mark on this land, 
so have Joulee's Gapples! Golden and Hand-crafted!§r 
#- §cThere is plenty to look at in this space, including event items and decorations. You can spend a while just wandering about looking at the collection. Somehow Bama got a golden carrot shop here, don't know how but... hey Carrot King, HR would like to see you.
Anyway...§r
#- §cI really like this shop! 

And you can find a couple of enchanting books, enderchests, and of course The Gapples. There's also some extra warps to check out on the wall.§r

