§8+====+ §9Ask A Witch?
-------------------
§3Welcome to the Craftadia Advice Column! Here is what you do... Have any paranormal questions for the Deathcap Team? Send in your questions right here!§r 
#- §9✉ Reader Enocori
-------------------
Are the potions worth it? The souls scream so much & it really keeps me up at night, but I just feel like I haven't gotten the right blend, not yet?
-------------------§r
§3Stay strong Eno, brewing potions is not for the faint of heart. You will get it right! 
#- §9✉ Reader ShyGuy
-------------------
How can I be as awesome as you? 
Or at least get me started on the road to being more amazing like you?
-------------------§r
§3Stay strong ShyGuy, being awesome is not for the faint of heart. You will get it right XD §6That's sweet ty ;)❤§r 
#- §9✉ Reader Demi
-------------------
Theres something strange in the neighborhood. I keep getting controlled by Dice. I keep getting flashes in my brain of a Dragon Egg. 
I need a drink...
-------------------§r
§3Ummm... what?! Umm... let's meet up and have that drink shall we? 
#- §9✉ Reader 'Unknown'
-------------------
I need advice. A scientist she calls herself has put me in a asylum cell. I don't remember how I got here. I just woke up here & she slammed the door on the cell. I'm sending my owl for an S.O.S... 
-------------------§r§3 §6(☉_ ☉)§5§( (☉_ ☉)§  umm...§r
#- §5Are you sure giving 'advice' was the best idea for you?§r
§6It felt like a good idea.§r
§5At the time?§r
§6Yeah... at the time.§r
§5Well I guess with you being a so-called Ghostbuster now, this kind of thing comes with the job...§r
§6I'm a witch, not a miracle worker... and why are you still here!§r
